        <p>COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON. Tc MUNICIPAL ELECTIONS, NOVEMBER lel., 1905. 0 THE ELECTORS OF ROWLEY WARD. LADIES AIM GENTLEMEN, I beg to tender my sincerest thanks to the Electors of the Ward who supported me so successfully on Wellies- day ; also to those who worked so hard for my return. As the representative for HowleyWarrl I will endeavour to do my duty satisfactorily to all parties. Again thankitig you. I sun, Ladies and Gentlemen, Your olterlie,t servant. THOMAS CH&amp;NTLER. 92. Mersey-street, Warrington.</p>
