        <p>INDIGESTION WIND-BLOATING, DIZZINESS, BACKACHE, HEADACHE, FEAR OF FOOD, ALL GIVE WAY TO MOTHER SEIGEL9 S SYRUP. "For many years I suffered from indigestion and biliousness. I tried one medicine and another and dragged on till I grew very weak and nervous. I could not bear the thought of food and when I did eat, as I had to do, it all returned. At times I could not keep even a drop of milk on my stomach. I had awful pains too, in my bead, chest, and back, and was bloated with wind. I grew so weak that when I went out I became sick and dizzy. I became depressed and nervous and would sit brooding over my helpless lot • . . For nearly a year I was un- der doctors, but it was not until I tried Mother Seigel 'S Syrup that any relief came. The first bottle did me a world of good, and *when I had finished a second bottle I was almost well. I could eat and sleep, my pain and dizziness left me and picked up so rapidly that soon I was completely cured. I take the Syrup now, when I feel the need of it, and recommend it to my friends." Mrs. Rose Ravenhill, 32, Spring Gardens, Doncaster, Sept. Ist., 1905. PRICE 2/6 AND 1434 PER BOTTLE. • The aleS bottle contains 3 times as much as the ifs% size.</p>
